    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even if i'm human, it doesn't change the fact that it feels wrong. like i'm an error message that keeps popping up in a program that's supposed to be running smooth. it's like i'm just... extra data. unnecessary weight in the system. wouldn't it be easier if the error was just cleared? if the system could just go back to being clean without me in it?",
